jligandmpnn is a JAX/Equinox port of LigandMPNN.

LigandMPNN
  https://github.com/dauparas/LigandMPNN
  Justas Dauparas et al., "Atomic context-conditioned protein sequence design
  using LigandMPNN", Nature Methods (2025).
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The model architecture and the released checkpoints (ligandmpnn_v_32_*) are the
work of the LigandMPNN authors. This repository reimplements the ligand_mpnn
inference path in JAX and loads their published weights via `from_torch`; it adds
a differentiable soft-sequence path (`score_soft`). Not affiliated with the authors.
